sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant LoginPage as Login Form
    participant WebServer as Web Server
    participant DB as Database
    participant SettingsPage as Settings Page
    
    User->>LoginPage: Enter credentials + submit
    LoginPage->>WebServer: POST /auth/login.php {email, password}
    WebServer->>DB: Query user by email
    DB-->>WebServer: User record
    WebServer->>WebServer: Verify password_verify()
    WebServer->>WebServer: Create session + localStorage
    WebServer-->>LoginPage: Redirect /home.html + Set-Cookie
    LoginPage->>LoginPage: Store in localStorage
    User->>SettingsPage: Navigate to settings.html
    SettingsPage->>WebServer: GET /api/preferences/get.php (session token)
    WebServer->>DB: Query preferences where user_id
    DB-->>WebServer: preferences JSON
    WebServer-->>SettingsPage: Return JSON
    SettingsPage->>SettingsPage: Populate form fields
    SettingsPage->>SettingsPage: Display logged-in user name
